  "colour": {
   "confidence": "photo-measured",
   "note": "The front face is the median of 2400 pixels of bare plate under the third block in the data sheet's Figure 1, #d3d4d1. The lamp strips are a pale yellow there; their value and the ink's are chosen by eye against the same photograph."
