   "note": "Four sources, none of them committed. (1) Catalyst 4948E and Catalyst 4948E-F Switch Installation Guide, OL-21561-02, 162 pages: Table 1-1 features, Table 1-2 specifications, Figures 1-1, 1-2 and 1-7, Table 1-5 LEDs, appendix A power supplies. (2) Cisco Catalyst 4948E and 4948E-F Ethernet Switches Data Sheet, c78-598933, 9 pages: Table 1, Table 2, Table 4, and Figures 1 to 3, which are square-on photographs of the front and of both rear builds. (3) Cisco's end-of-sale notice EOL11273. (4) Photographs of real units from resale listings, for what the small data-sheet photographs cannot resolve. THE GUIDE'S OWN CHASSIS FIGURES ARE ISOMETRIC LINE DRAWINGS and gave callouts only. No vendor 3D model and no stencil render was found."
  },
  "the-four-blocks": {
