   "note": "The 24 columns stand in four blocks of six. Their first openings read 25, 193, 361 and 531 px - steps of 168, 168 and 170 - so a least-squares block step of 90.59 mm starting at 10.4, a 6.77 gutter. That fits the four starts to 0.2, 0.1, 0.7 and 0.3 mm. A captive-looking screw sits in each gutter and a fourth before the uplinks."
  },
